<title>GERMANY: German cartel office-bank merger talks taken place.</title>
<headline>German cartel office-bank merger talks taken place.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German cartel office said on Monday that preliminary discussions concerning the planned merger of Germany's two major Bavarian banks had already taken place.</p>
<p>The office said it was expecting to receive formal notification of the merger plans in the next few days.  </p>
<p>A spokeswoman for the office declined to comment on the likely ruling by the office, noting that the authority would have four months from the registration of the merger plans to make its decision.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
